  "historyNote": "#7715, INTERIM, eff 6-21-02, EXPIRES: 12-19-02; ss by #7753, eff 8-19-02; ss by #9744, eff 7-1-10, EXPIRED: 7-1-18 New. #12652, eff 10-27-18",
